One design decision I'd make now

I would not merge the live 511 information into the offline map itself.

Keep these separate:

BASE GRAPH
OSM / government roads

STATIC RESTRICTIONS
bridges / dimensions / road authority

LIVE OVERLAY
511 / closures / weather / road conditions

VEHICLE STATE
weight / height / axles / permits / DG

ROUTE
calculated result

That way a bad 511 update can't corrupt your actual map database.

It also means that when the driver loses internet in the bush, the underlying road network continues to work.

The app can show:

ROUTING DATA
Offline ✓

511 LIVE DATA
Last synchronized:
18 min ago ⚠

rather than pretending that old information is current.


